  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A clean, velvety-matte bronzer that leaves skin looking healthy, natural, and authentically bronzed.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Matte</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation: </strong>Pressed Powder</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p >-Phytosqualane (plant-derived): Smooth, streak-free application, restores suppleness</p><p>-Volcanic rock and special effects pigments: Absorbs excess oil, mattifies without clogging, boosts lasting power</p><p>-Pomegranate extract: Antioxidant-rich to neutralize free radicals, supports healthy-looking skin</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>How to Use:&nbsp;<br></strong></p><p>Gucci Westman's Tip:</p><p>- Sweep in a horizontal motion over the cheeks, eyelids, temples and forehead. Anywhere the sun would naturally hit.</p><p>- As a general rule do not go below the cheekbones.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>•Using the Westman Atelier Powder Brush, swirl brush into bronzing powder and tap off excess.</p><p>•Apply to neck and collarbones if they're showing.</p><p>• Includes linen pouch</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >MICA, SQUALANE, ZINC STEARATE, PERLITE, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC</p><p>TRIGLYCERIDE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, CHLORPHENSIN, PUNICA GRANATUM</p><p>PERICARP EXTRACT, ALUMINUM HYDROXIDE, ROSA HYBRID FLOWER EXTRACT, MAY</p><p>CONTAIN/ PEUT CONTENIR (+/-): BISMUTH OXYCHLORIDE (CI 77163), IRON OXIDES (CI</p><p>77491, 74492, 7499), YELLOW 5 LAKE (CI 19140), RED 7 LAKE (CI 15850), TITANIUM</p><p>DIOXIDE (CI 77891)<br><br><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A clean, velvety-matte bronzer that leaves skin looking healthy, natural, and authentically bronzed.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Matte</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation: </strong>Pressed Powder</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p >-Phytosqualane (plant-derived): Smooth, streak-free application, restores suppleness</p><p>-Volcanic rock and special effects pigments: Absorbs excess oil, mattifies without clogging, boosts lasting power</p><p>-Pomegranate extract: Antioxidant-rich to neutralize free radicals, supports healthy-looking skin</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>How to Use:&nbsp;<br></strong></p><p>Gucci Westman's Tip:</p><p>- Sweep in a horizontal motion over the cheeks, eyelids, temples and forehead. Anywhere the sun would naturally hit.</p><p>- As a general rule do not go below the cheekbones.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>•Using the Westman Atelier Powder Brush, swirl brush into bronzing powder and tap off excess.</p><p>•Apply to neck and collarbones if they're showing.</p><p>• Includes linen pouch</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >MICA, SQUALANE, ZINC STEARATE, PERLITE, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC</p><p>TRIGLYCERIDE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, CHLORPHENSIN, PUNICA GRANATUM</p><p>PERICARP EXTRACT, ALUMINUM HYDROXIDE, ROSA HYBRID FLOWER EXTRACT, MAY</p><p>CONTAIN/ PEUT CONTENIR (+/-): BISMUTH OXYCHLORIDE (CI 77163), IRON OXIDES (CI</p><p>77491, 74492, 7499), YELLOW 5 LAKE (CI 19140), RED 7 LAKE (CI 15850), TITANIUM</p><p>DIOXIDE (CI 77891)<br><br><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
